1 REM FBCS ECMA-0248
2 REM CLAIM A-ECMA-15
3 REM TYPE SELF
4 REM ECMA 7.1.3 ex. 10 is the body of DECLARE STRING; the full form is accepted (MAXLEN 8, bounds 3, 21)
100 DECLARE STRING A$(3 TO 21) * 8
110 IF MAXLEN(A$)=8 AND LBOUND(A$)=3 AND UBOUND(A$)=21 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT "*** TEST FAILED ***"
120 END
